{
  "$comment": "The shim's call surface (docs/03-design/compat-shim.md §3): one row a function, its baseline entry points in the inventory's words, its kind and the SDK call that answers it. A refused row names the guide anchor that explains it and what to do instead. HAND-WRITTEN; surface.test.mjs holds the package to it.",
